---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Nav from "../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Use"
  description="Terms of use for the Hubei Province Travel Guide: content is provided for general information, prices and policies change, and linked official sources govern your actual trip."
  noindex={true}
>
  <Nav solid />
  <main class="pt-32 pb-20 md:pt-40 md:pb-28">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-stone-900 pb-1">Terms of Use</h1>
      <div class="mt-8 space-y-5 text-stone-600 leading-relaxed">
        <p>
          The Hubei Province Travel Guide is an independent, free information site. By using it you accept these terms.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-8">Information as-is</h2>
        <p>
          Prices, schedules, visa rules and opening hours in this guide are our best observations and cross-checks as of August 2026,
          but they change without notice. Always confirm against the official sources we link to (visa policy, railway booking,
          attraction pages) before you book or travel. We are not responsible for losses caused by acting on outdated information.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-8">No bookings, no affiliation</h2>
        <p>
          We do not sell tickets, rooms or tours, and we are not affiliated with any tourism board, booking platform or government body.
          Any third-party brand names appear only to identify official information sources.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-8">Content rights</h2>
        <p>
          The text of this guide is our original work. You may quote short passages with a link back to this page;
          please do not republish whole sections. Photographs are credited to their Wikimedia Commons authors and licenses in the footer.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-8">External links</h2>
        <p>
          We link to third-party sites for official data. We do not control their content or availability and accept no responsibility for them.
        </p>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 mt-8">Changes</h2>
        <p>
          We may update these terms as the site evolves. Last updated: August 2026.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
